### GYMS REQUESTS

### Create a new Gym
POST http://localhost:8080/api/gyms-management/gyms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "street1",
  "phoneNumber": "000-000-001"
}

###
### Create another Gym
POST http://localhost:8080/api/gyms-management/gyms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "street2",
  "phoneNumber": "000-000-002"
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/gyms-management/gyms


### MEMBERSHIPS REQUESTS

### Create Membership in existing Gym
POST http://localhost:8082/api/memberships-management/gyms/34f12efd-76a6-4aa0-890d-bb0d646b4edb/memberships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Membership1",
  "type": "BASIC",
  "monthlyPrice": {
    "value": 100.99,
    "currency": "PLN"
  },
  "duration": 6,
  "maxMembers": 10
}

###
### Create another Membership in the same Gym
POST http://localhost:8082/api/memberships-management/gyms/34f12efd-76a6-4aa0-890d-bb0d646b4edb/memberships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Membership2",
  "type": "PREMIUM",
  "monthlyPrice": {
    "value": 10000.99,
    "currency": "EUR"
  },
  "duration": 12,
  "maxMembers": 3
}

###
### Try to add Person to non-existing House
POST http://localhost:8082/api/memberships-management/gyms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/memberships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost",
  "type": "PREMIUM",
  "monthlyPrice": {
    "value": 1.00,
    "currency": "EUR"
  },
  "duration": 0,
  "maxMembers": 0
}

###
### Get all People
GET http://localhost:8082/api/memberships-management/memberships